        "subject": "LU-17620 tests: Disable migration in racer for now",
        "message": "LU-17620 tests: Disable migration in racer for now\n\nIt was observed that a lot of racer problems come from migration code,\nboth the file and directory kinds.\nLet's disable that for now, stabilize the other parts of it and then\nfix the migration problems and then reenable it in racer.\n\nThis is esp. true as we know there are several lock deadlocks we\nknow about in migration code.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: optional testlist=racer\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ica270509ae2cafb61bef428883020093f1307d17\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67431\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
